      "content": "4.4 Tourism"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "e1whnd2",
      "content": "Tourism is one of Kerala's primary revenue earners. The state was branded 'God's Own Country' in 1989. It attracts millions of domestic and international tourists annually."
